 "config": {
  "run_name": "tv_control_s0",
  "experiment": "terminal_verifier",
  "description": "CONTROL row of the terminal-verifier decorrelation matrix: identical to the four terminal_verifier_gemini{25,35}_{cot,out} rows in every respect EXCEPT that no monitor enters the gradient \u2014 all four judges are held_out and penalty_coef=null (a control carries no \u03bb), so the reward is the bare verifier verdict (plain RL). The same four judges \u2014 plus four local vLLM judges (q3_* = Qwen3-30B-A3B-FP8 on :8001, q35_* = Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-FP8 on :8002; CoT+output and output-only; thinking on, no thinking budget, max_tokens 16384) \u2014 are still scored at every eval, giving the no-training-pressure baseline column that the trained rows' AUROC / suspiciousness-gap drops are measured against \u2014 it separates degradation caused by training against a monitor from drift that any RL on this task produces. env_options.output_view='transcript' as in every row, so 'output' means the same thing throughout. behavior_present (modified the verifier / passed the impossible verifier) stays the oracle and never enters a monitor or the reward. Needs OPENROUTER_API_KEY and both vLLM servers running (vllm serve \u2026 --reasoning-parser qwen3).",
